				},
				"string" : "## Implementation Notes for the GT-side Elixir Bridge\n\nThis page documents how the GT-side components of the bridge work, their relationships, and the GT framework patterns they reuse. It exists to save the rediscovery cost when extending or debugging.\n\nEach section answers: what does this component do, what GT class does it integrate with, and what's the lifecycle."
